      "narrative": null,
      "content": "The National Health Workforce Accounts Handbook was developed under the direction of the World \nHealth Organization (WHO) Health Workforce Department as an accompanying document to support the \nimplementation of the Global Strategy on Human Resources for Health: Workforce 2030.\nWHO is grateful to members of the Technical Advisory Group on National Health Workforce Accounts, \nwho provided guidance and technical input to the development of the concept and the elaboration of the \nHandbook: Adam Ahmat, Edson Araujo, Zoltan Aszalos, Ronald Batenburg, James Buchan, Ariella Camera, \nJim Campbell, Zol",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Acknowledges the contributions of the WHO Health Workforce Department, the Technical Advisory Group on National Health Workforce Accounts, partner organizations, and external experts who guided and reviewed the handbook, along with financial support from USAID, the European Commission, and the Norwegian Agency for Development Cooperation.",
