      "content": "Workforce Accounts – \nIndicators\nNational Health Workforce Accounts: A Handbook\n1\t\nActive health workforce stock\n2 \t Education and training\n3\t Education and training regulation and accreditation\n4\t Education finances\n5\t Health labour market flows",
