      "target": "../sections/sec-017-modular-overview-with-corresponding-dimensions.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Stock\n•\tHealth worker density\n•\tHealth worker density at subnational level\nEntry into labour market\n•\tGraduates starting practice within one year\n•\tReplenishment rate from domestic efforts\n•\tEntry rate of foreign health workers\nDistribution\n•\tHealth worker distribution by age group\n•\tFemale health workforce\n•\tHealth worker distribution by facility \nownership\n•\tHealth worker distribution by facility type\nExit from labour market\n•\tVoluntary exit rate from health  \nlabour market\n•\tInvoluntary exit rate from health  \nlabour market\nMigration\n•\tShare of foreign-born health workers\n•\tShare of foreign",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Presents a complete tabular overview of all 78 NHWA indicators grouped by module (Modules 1 to 10) and by thematic dimension within each module.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
